{"title":"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cbbeb5834997d74dbc44264f04660c2bf84077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> with one side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> inches and area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> square inches. Rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca5f6500d904b18c0eaf34da49a31bd3fb72d7f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> with diagonal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> inches is similar to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cbbeb5834997d74dbc44264f04660c2bf84077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />. Expressed in square inches the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca5f6500d904b18c0eaf34da49a31bd3fb72d7f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/6993fc33fa07e8d0aa35d1f1850f18dd70fdbda1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 9/2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 36 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 135/2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 9\\sqrt{10} \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 27\\sqrt{10}/4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"509\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Clearly, the other side of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cbbeb5834997d74dbc44264f04660c2bf84077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/8/e387f4f12329f626a1a74ad97158aac2a71d44fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}2=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" />.\nNow call the sides of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca5f6500d904b18c0eaf34da49a31bd3fb72d7f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> a and b, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/f/9dfc685c058a3923bc44dc7a591ea65066c69dea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/3/a93f769c81ca2a91570f98c2d27d29a86d693fb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b}a=\\frac31=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"39\" />, because the two rectangles are similar. We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87b3f52688f2903a384b3803a49faae6cad0412b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2=15^2=225$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"155\" height=\"16\" />. But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/0/0605d04200311f4c282fe68b4a10d2e306a9459e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=3a$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />, so substituting gives \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/2/122c79a916eef044962f7a765a99ec70d6fafe61.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2+(3a)^2=225\\]\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/5/c158aaad5a5178d713583e34cf6a260a9988299c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10a^2=225\\]\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca6ddfd7f836ccbace7c6e3f92da80e6bcee48ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2=\\frac{45}2\\]\" width=\"61\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/b/9fbbaf3bdadb6848aa58dadcc8d921316317046a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a=\\frac{3\\sqrt{10}}2\\]\" width=\"78\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/f/50f664b0695ea25a59c3489c95ceb7d60b5ebccd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b=\\frac{9\\sqrt{10}}2\\]\" width=\"76\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/0/1900ccd39fce190d04007f39ea3fef4cdc0f9ae3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[R_2]=ab=\\boxed{\\frac{135}2\\textbf{ (C)}}\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME\" title=\"1962 AHSME\">1962 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Answe